      "is_free": false,
      "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you always dreamed of joining Alice as she journeys in Wonderland and Through the Looking Glass? In this Hidden Objects game, your dream comes true! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong>🔍 <strong>Key features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 360° scenes &amp; zoom: rotate panoramas, zoom into details, spot cleverly hidden items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Multiple modes: list, silhouettes, pairs — play at your preferred pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Hints &amp; comfort: gentle difficulty, no intrusive timers or penalties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Story &amp; collections: gather artifacts and unlock new chapters of Wonderland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Wonderland atmosphere: vivid locations, vintage items, charming music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Short sessions: perfect for bite‑sized relaxing play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/839670/extras/e91e432af1688ba0ddeb45819ee3226a.avif?t=1759620211\" width=600 height=406 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help the heroine solve puzzles and find cleverly disguised clues so she can advance through this wondrous land.  Dive into the world of fantasy!</p>",
      "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you always dreamed of joining Alice as she journeys in Wonderland and Through the Looking Glass? In this Hidden Objects game, your dream comes true! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong>🔍 <strong>Key features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 360° scenes &amp; zoom: rotate panoramas, zoom into details, spot cleverly hidden items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Multiple modes: list, silhouettes, pairs — play at your preferred pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Hints &amp; comfort: gentle difficulty, no intrusive timers or penalties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Story &amp; collections: gather artifacts and unlock new chapters of Wonderland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Wonderland atmosphere: vivid locations, vintage items, charming music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Short sessions: perfect for bite‑sized relaxing play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/839670/extras/e91e432af1688ba0ddeb45819ee3226a.avif?t=1759620211\" width=600 height=406 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help the heroine solve puzzles and find cleverly disguised clues so she can advance through this wondrous land.  Dive into the world of fantasy!</p>",
      "short_description": "A cozy hidden objects adventure in Wonderland. Colorful 360-degree scenery, animation, and 3D visual effects will make your adventure vivid and fun! Scroll, zoom, use hints; no stress, just exploration.",
      "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Czech, Dutch, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Turkish, Ukrainian",
      "reviews": "“All the levels are made with a 360 degree panoramic view, which is very cool. You must win each of the stages to unlock the next. As with all Hidden Objects games, you’ll have to scan the environment carefully and memorise the positions of all the objects...Graphically, most of the scenes are well done, and the items can be difficult to find. The soundtrack is very good and suits the game superbly. In terms of the controls, you use your mouse, and it works fine.”<br>zeepond (The_Cpt_FROGGY CLUB)<br>",
